      "name": null,
      "problem": "If $a=⟨-3,5⟩$, then what is the magnitude of $a?$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\,| & =\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-3)^{2}+(5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+25} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{34}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
